file=Finance & Treasury/treasure/operational/tool/treasure-tool-requirements.md · t·t:treasure \· tool requirements=> **States needs, not grants** (§7).\n · tb=\| Skill \| Required \| Optional \| Source line \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| entity-account-map \| File read/write (masked view) \| Bank MCP for balance auto-fetch \· Secure store for account numbers \| All steps \| · tb=\| fx-exposure \| File read (config, ledger, accounts) \| Web fetch (rate source) \· Rate API MCP \| All steps \| · tb=\| cash-management \| File read (config, account map, balances) \| Bank MCP for auto-refresh \| All steps \| · t·t:treasure \· tool requirements=Sensitive data (account numbers, signatory details) — never in plain output; masked view only. Full data lives in secure-store integration configured per operator.\n\nGovernance/policy in `treasure-config.md`.\n